+The rest of this file is the long form of those rules: how the repository is organized, what each
+module guarantees, the conventions reviewers hold changes to, and the answers to questions that come
+up in almost every task. It is reference material. Read the section that matches the task and skip
+the rest; the five rules above always apply and win over anything below.
